  "assembly_overrides": [
    "U8 pin4 routed through R7 to MAIN_EFUSE_EN; overrides direct output in individual driver candidate",
    "U9 RESET goes to RAIL_HEALTH_N instead of EN; U7 MR receives RAIL_HEALTH_N instead of LOGIC3V3; U11 level buffer and U10 reset follower drive EN",
    "U3 unused second AND gate: pins3,4,5 accept ENABLE_PERMISSION, SEQUENCE_ENABLE_REQUEST, RESET_N; pin6 drives U8 input POWER_ENABLE_COMMAND"
  ],
